[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0211","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0211.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0232","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0/2000 TCP/IP Printing Service 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 系统的 TCP/IP 打印服务（Print Services for Unix）存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标系统的打印服务端口发送特制的畸形 TCP/IP 打印请求，即可导致打印服务崩溃或系统资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞危害等级较低，但影响 Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 系列版本，攻击者可在局域网或远程环境下实施攻击。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0232"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:16Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft Security Bulletin MS00-021 对应补丁。在 Windows 2000 中禁用 TCP/IP Print Server (LPDSVC) 服务；在 Windows NT 4.0 中停止并禁用 \"TCP/IP Print Server\" 服务。在防火墙层面过滤入站 515 端口 (LPD) 流量，阻断外部打印请求。如打印服务非业务必需，建议永久禁用该服务以彻底消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0306.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1082","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-021","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19827","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0232.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0232","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0232.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0232.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-58qq-6frr-hh6q/GHSA-58qq-6frr-hh6q.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0232.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001254.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9cf3d83f-f611-4a81-a1a8-6cd093c2a2c3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0211.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0136","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0136.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0152","title":"Novell BorderManager 3.0/3.5 Telnet连接拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Novell BorderManager 3.0 及 3.5 版本中 Telnet 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向端口 2000 发起 Telnet 连接并反复按回车键，导致系统代理服务崩溃或资源耗尽，造成服务不可用。该漏洞攻击门槛低，仅需基本的网络连接能力即可触发危害。Novell 官方尚未发布有效补丁，受影响系统面临持续性拒绝服务攻击风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0152"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:06Z","remediation":"升级 Novell BorderManager 至 3.6 或更高版本，或在防火墙层面限制对 2000 端口的 telnet 访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。如产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的替代产品并完全禁用 telnet 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7468","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/976","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19746","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0152.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0152","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0152.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0152.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j87h-5rjf-7jm7/GHSA-j87h-5rjf-7jm7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0152.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/novell_border_manager.nasl","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001253.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0136.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0706","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0244","title":"Citrix Metaframe ICA协议弱加密漏洞","description":"Citrix MetaFrame 1.0 及 1.8 版本中的 ICA（独立计算架构）协议使用 XOR 弱加密算法对用户认证数据进行加密，由于 XOR 加密极易被逆向破解，处于同一网络中的攻击者可通过嗅探网络流量截获认证会话并还原明文凭据，进而获取系统未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Citrix MetaFrame 1.0 和 1.8 版本，建议升级或启用替代加密方案。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0244"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:18Z","remediation":"升级至 Citrix Metaframe 1.8 以上版本，ICA 协议在后续版本中改用 RC5 加密替代 XOR。如无法升级，在 Citrix 服务器上启用 SSL/TLS 中继（Secure ICA），强制客户端通过 TLS 加密通道连接，并在服务器防火墙中限制仅允许受信 IP 访问 ICA 端口 1494。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1077","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.BSO.4.20.0003290949280.2640-100000%40naughty.monkey.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19821","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0244.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0244","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0244.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6a25a9384d7c18dfb53a1d1532073678a2c29fe5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0244.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c2cj-5326-gh33/GHSA-c2cj-5326-gh33.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1077/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e84b840b-8ee3-4c8f-9076-61ebc55935ed.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0708","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0245","title":"SGI IRIX 5.x/6.x Objectserver 远程创建用户账户漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统 5.x 及 6.x 版本自带的 objectserver 守护进程存在权限验证漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过网络向目标系统的 objectserver 端口发送特制请求，利用该漏洞可创建任意用户账户，进而获取系统访问权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 全系列 5.x/6.x 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0245"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:18Z","remediation":"立即升级到 SGI IRIX 6.5.x 最新维护版本，或应用 SGI 针对 objectserver 漏洞的官方安全补丁。如无法升级，建议在 inetd 配置中禁用 objectserver 服务（注释掉 /etc/inetd.conf 中 objectserver 行并重启 inetd），同时通过防火墙限制对 7000/tcp 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/k-030.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1267","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1079","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200003290852.aa27218%40blaze.arl.mil","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4206","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19822","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0245.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0245","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0245.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0245.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5mph-j4pc-j2jr/GHSA-5mph-j4pc-j2jr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3d5215bd-f403-43b0-87f5-7cbdc92e1257.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0245.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--3d5215bd-f403-43b0-87f5-7cbdc92e1257.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0708.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0278","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0278.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0289","title":"Linux Kernel IP Masquerading 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Linux 2.2.x 内核的 IP 伪装（IP masquerading）功能存在安全漏洞，远程攻击者可通过修改外部源 IP 地址和端口号，使其与已建立连接的参数相匹配，从而将 UDP 数据包路由至内部接口。该漏洞允许攻击者绕过防火墙规则访问内部网络资源，影响运行 Linux 2.2.x 内核的系统。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞，但需要掌握已建立连接的相关信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0289"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.x 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续内核版本中修复。如无法升级内核，可在防火墙规则中限制 UDP 端口转发，仅允许已知合法源 IP 的 UDP 流量通过，并启用 iptables 的 conntrack 状态检查以验证连接合法性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0284.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_48.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1078","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0289.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0289","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0289.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0289.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-899q-9xm5-3mvx/GHSA-899q-9xm5-3mvx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3c95b69b-c02a-42e1-8845-a26f69756332.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6520b7035e49edd5877b71a9dd144df4ccfe9c24/2000/CVE-2000-0289.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0278.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0213","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0213.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0235","title":"FreeBSD orville-write huh 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统 orville-write 软件包中的 huh 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该程序提交特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用后可获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响多版本 FreeBSD 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0235"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-27T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:17Z","remediation":"升级 orville-write 包至 2.50 及以上版本。如无法升级，移除 `huh` 程序的 setuid root 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/local/bin/huh`；若不需要该功能，直接卸载 orville-write 包：`pkg_delete orville-write`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1263","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1070","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0235.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0235","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0235.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0235.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mp4x-527r-p76p/GHSA-mp4x-527r-p76p.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/