es":["CVE-2000-0242"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-03-25T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-03-25T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 WindMail 至 3.0 以上版本，或安装厂商发布的安全补丁。如已停止支持，应对用户输入中的 | & ; $ ` 等 shell 元字符进行严格过滤，避免拼接至系统命令。建议迁移至仍在维护的邮件客户端（如 Thunderbird、Outlook），并限制邮件服务器对内部命令执行接口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1073","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-03-22&msg=20000325224146.6839.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19819"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0220.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0220.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0220.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0203","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0203.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0227","title":"Linux Kernel 2.2.x Unix域套接字本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 2.2.x 内核未对 Unix 域套接字数量进行有效限制，未授权本地攻击者可通过不断创建大量套接字耗尽系统资源，从而触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.2.12/2.2.14/2.3.99 及 RedHat 6.x 等版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，属于本地提权类拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0227"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:16Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.0 或更高版本（该漏洞已在 2.4.0 内核中修复），或安装对应发行版的安全补丁（如 RedHat 6.x 的 errata 更新）。对于无法升级内核的遗留系统，可通过 sysctl 调整 net.core.wmem_max 参数限制单进程 socket 占用上限，并监控异常 socket 创建行为作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0254.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95421263519558&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1072","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4186","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19818","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/